mor de los pobres.", "words": [[0, 73647], [7, 74322], [18, 75032], [21, 75172], [28, 75672], [31, 75792], [38, 76292], [41, 76432], [48, 77216], [51, 77345], [54, 77505], [61, 78005], [65, 78145], [72, 78665], [75, 78785], [79, 78905]]}, {"verse": 13, "start": 79948, "end": 88678, "text": "Ten misericordia de mí, Jehová: mira mi aflicción que padezco de los que me aborrecen, tú que me levantas de las puertas de la muerte;", "words": [[0, 79948], [4, 80208], [17, 81028], [20, 81345], [24, 81661], [32, 82171], [37, 82480], [40, 82720], [50, 83440], [54, 83640], [62, 84320], [65, 84459], [69, 84580], [73, 84739], [76, 85380], [87, 86020], [90, 86420], [94, 86620], [97, 86739], [106, 87220], [109, 87300], [113, 87420], [121, 87820], [124, 87959], [127, 88060]]}, {"verse": 14, "start": 89028, "end": 95281, "text": "Porque cuente yo todas tus alabanzas en las puertas de la hija de Sion, y me goce en tu salvación.", "words": [[0, 89028], [7, 89370], [14, 89750], [17, 89990], [23, 90370], [27, 90610], [37, 91370], [40, 91510], [44, 91650], [52, 92070], [55, 92230], [58, 92330], [63, 92630], [66, 92730], [72, 93130], [74, 93610], [77, 93750], [82, 94130], [85, 94250], [88, 94390]]}, {"verse": 15, "start": 95631, "end": 101533, "text": "Se hundieron las naciones en la fosa que hicieron; en la red que escondieron fue tomado su pie.", "words": [[0, 95631], [3, 95866], [13, 96306], [17, 96506], [26, 96966], [29, 97206], [32, 97346], [37, 97666], [41, 97846], [51, 98904], [54, 99082], [57, 99282], [61, 99582], [65, 99822], [77, 100382], [81, 100602], [88, 100982], [91, 101122]]}, {"verse": 16, "start": 101883, "end": 110534, "text": "Jehová fue conocido en el juicio que hizo; en la obra de sus manos fue enlazado el malo. (Higaion. Selah.)", "words": [[0, 101883], [7, 102582], [11, 102702], [20, 103382], [23, 103502], [26, 103642], [33, 104062], [37, 104302], [43, 105090], [46, 105238], [49, 105398], [54, 105678], [57, 105858], [61, 106018], [67, 106458], [71, 107038], [80, 107678], [83, 107798], [89, 109092], [99, 110215]]}, {"verse": 17, "start": 110884, "end": 116394, "text": "Los malos serán trasladados al infierno, todas las gentes que se olvidan de Dios.", "words": [[0, 110884], [4, 111003], [10, 111483], [16, 111843], [28, 112623], [31, 112803], [41, 113803], [47, 114203], [51, 114603], [58, 115003], [62, 115083], [65, 115223], [73, 115683], [76, 115823]]}, {"verse": 18, "start": 116744, "end": 123127, "text": "Porque no para siempre será olvidado el pobre; ni la esperanza de los pobres perecerá perpetuamente.", "words": [[0, 116744], [7, 116949], [10, 117169], [15, 117409], [23, 117709], [28, 118189], [37, 118869], [40, 119009], [47, 119921], [50, 120059], [53, 120219], [63, 120739], [66, 120879], [70, 121019], [77, 121379], [86, 121959]]}, {"verse": 19, "start": 123477, "end": 130268, "text": "Levántate, oh Jehová; no se fortalezca el hombre; sean juzgadas las naciones delante de ti.", "words": [[0, 123477], [11, 124156], [14, 124834], [22, 125677], [25, 125804], [28, 125964], [39, 126584], [42, 126704], [50, 127402], [55, 127662], [64, 128362], [68, 128782], [77, 129322], [85, 129742], [88, 129882]]}, {"verse": 20, "start": 130618, "end": 136713, "text": "Pon, oh Jehová, temor en ellos: conozcan las naciones que son no más que hombres. (Selah.)", "words": [[0, 130618], [5, 130920], [8, 131260], [16, 131600], [22, 132060], [25, 132220], [32, 133450], [41, 133540], [45, 133660], [54, 134080], [58, 134260], [62, 134513], [65, 134767], [69, 135020], [73, 135140], [82, 136364]]}]}